@startuml credit-application
' NON-COMPLIANT on purpose. Deliberate defects:
'   - the score decision does not say which branch approves (ACT003, twice)
'   - the process never reaches an end (ACT002, major: the build fails)
'   - CRD-105, "the customer is informed", is cited by no diagram (trace)
title Credit application
footer owner: Retail Credit · CRD-101 CRD-102 CRD-103 CRD-104

|Customer|
start
:Submit credit application;
|Credit officer|
:Check completeness;
if (Application complete?) then (yes)
  |Risk engine|
  :Score applicant;
  if (Score sufficient?) then
    |Credit officer|
    :Approve credit;
  else
    |Credit officer|
    :Reject application;
  endif
else (no)
  |Credit officer|
  :Request missing documents;
endif
|Credit officer|
:Inform customer;
@enduml
